dult content:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To unlock adult events, the player must acquire the seduction skill! The higher the level, the faster the heroine can seduce monsters!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845430/extras/67d1aea793125032bef0cd3dd0f6a909.avif?t=1754673694\" width=800 height=175 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This skill is necessary to activate sexual interactions with monsters!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845430/extras/15ab2793c05ff2e570ec59e5e73257e2.avif?t=1754673694\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 7 types of monsters that the heroine can interact with! For each monster, there are 5 unique animated scenes. All animations are adult content!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845430/extras/64683286096054a942159f2194201cb8.avif?t=1754673694\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 9 random events with adult content that players can encounter on the upper floors! Each event has a unique animation!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845430/extras/329755d978894442a2cdbb7adb25c0d2.avif?t=1754673694\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events have a 30% chance of appearing!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img cl